 strongest man on earth  in his youth king won several video game  tournaments  now around the time period of one and a  half to three years ago he was attacked  by the octopus claw man who left king  with his trademark 3 scars on his face  during the attack king was saved by none  other than saitama who was training to  be a hero at the time  saitama actually went on to save king's  life in five more occasions but somehow  it would always end up in the same  result the king would unintentionally  get the credit for the defeat of these  monsters one of which being vaccine man  where king fell into the blood of  vaccine man near the incident so the  hero association saw this and decided to  capitalize on the reputation of king's  strength as such they made him an  s-class hero without him having to take  the hero examinator and through being  thrust into the public limelight as a  symbol king was dubbed as the strongest  man on earth  this theme continues with king where he  claims both money and reputation for  deeds he has not done himself as well as  this his hero name was given to him by  the hero association in honor of his air  quote strength when it came to defeating  a disaster level demon with ease somehow  king claimed the title  king of heroes  next up is the sixth rank s-class hero  bofoy also known by his hero name of  metal knight  again we have another s-class hero here  with a backstory that is relatively  unknown now we do know some origins of  his hero name thanks to the one punch  man data book his hero name metal knight  was a direct request from beaufort  himself as he believes his still robot  engages in the activities of peace such  as that of a knight i don't know about  you but this is definitely one of the  more ironic hero names as a knight  usually has the characteristics of being  you know chivalrous and want to have a  behavior that shows high morals and  standards  but with metal knight he's definitely  not these things he is more of a person  that is quite cold personality wise and  he also tends to deal with situations in  a more pragmatic nature and is pretty  much the direct opposite of what a hero  let alone a knight should be  don't you think  okay moving on to the youngest of the  s-class heroes and fifth-ranked child  emperor  child emperor is another hero whose  backstory hasn't been revealed to us all  we really know is from the one punch man  original web comic in which he and metal  knight had a somewhat history the web  comic tells us that sometime prior to  the events of the story child emperor  was once metal knight's assistant  it also tells us the child emperor once  fought and defeated all of atomic  samurai's disciples  however with that little knowledge on  this little guy  let's move on  kamikaze aka atomic samurai is next up  he is the rank 4 s-class hero one of the  most powerful heroes and a swordmaster  as well as being a member on the council  of sword masters  so before the founding of the hero  association kamikaze started a dojo it  was here that he approved only three  standout disciples who would work with  him as heroes moving forward  these three disciples were bushidrill  ian and okamaitachi  these three made the cut after an apple  cutting test pun intended by the way and  would join him in the hero association  kamikaze a master swordsman has the  ability to tell how a person lives or  has lived their lives by their ability  to cut using a sword and will only  recruit those worthy of passing this  test  now these three are all a-class heroes  however fubiki states that all of his  disciples should be s-class ranked and  that they aren't due to sweep masks  gatekeeping  moving on to bang aka silver fang the  martial arts master creator and teacher  of the water stream rock smashing fist  technique and the rank 3 s-class hero  in his past bang was a reckless and  violent guy who was involved with crime  he would constantly seek out and  challenge any strong opponent and would  put them in the hospital  his brother bomb was disgusted by his  brother's actions and decided to  confront him on this now before the  fight bomb had noted that his brother  thought he had gained extreme power  although he had not overcome himself and  this was the lesson he wanted to pummel  into his younger brother  bang ultimately lost the fight and  became enraged bomb told his younger  brother to call off before he left and  rightly so as this loss was the one that  taught bang the error of his ways and  made him really see the person that he  had become  seeing his errors bang followed in his  brother's footsteps and started a dojo  as well as this he started to create a  new defense orientated fighting style  over the years bomb would keep an eye on  his younger brother by visiting the dojo  he couldn't help but smile because of  his brother's new attitude his dojo was  passed down through generations as well  as the fighting style that he created  called water stream rock smashing fist  he created this star whilst training  under bomb and all of the scars that he  has now are from that time in which he  was trying to create this style  bang also took place in a super fight  tournament to promote his dojo and yeah  he won it many many students came from  bang's dojo but his most famous was his  top student  garu however one day whilst bang was  away garu went on a rampage through the  dojo injuring many of bang students when  bang found out about this he beat up  garu and banished him from the dojo this  rampage caused bang to lose all of his  students except for one charanco now  before the start of the series bang was  a b-class hero ranked 77th but was moved  into the s-class when it was formed  next up we have tatsumaki also known by  her hero name tornado of terror she is  rank two of the s-class heroes  now due to her psychic abilities  tatsumaki was taken away by scientists  from her adopted family at the age of  just 7 so that they could study her  powers her adopted family agreed and  were compensated for this with money  tatsumaki underwent tests by these  scientists who were looking into her  amazing powers for her compliance she  was rewarded with candy and toys however  she was always denied her requests of  going outside now when tatsumaki would  refuse to use her powers for the  scientists she was locked away in a cell  18 years ago when tatsumaki was aged 10  a monster outbreak occurred while she  was locked away in said cell this left  her alone and to fend off the monsters  herself however luckily for tatsumaki  she was saved by blast he introduced  himself to the young girl and asked her  why she didn't use her powers against  the monsters in order to save herself  tatsumaki lied to blast saying that they  weren't working but blast saw through  the lie he knew that she was holding  back her powers so that the scientist  would deem her useless and let her go  tatsumaki admitted to blast that this  was the case and also told him of her  heartbreak due to the fact that her  adopted parents had sold her out to this  fate  now somehow blast knew that tatsumaki  had a little sister  he told tatsumaki that he advises her  not to rely on someone to save her next  time and that she must become strong  herself in order to protect her family  now it was all because of blast and  these words that tatsumaki became a hero  okay final hero on the list is none  other than blast the rank one s-class  hero  unfortunately blast is another one of  those heroes where we don't know a lot  about his backstory or origins this is  largely down to the fact that blast  keeps all of his personal information  disclosed from the hero association  what we do know is of course the events  of 18 years ago in his involvement with  the young tatsumaki that we had just  talked about but other than that we do  not know much at all we do know that in  terms of his character it is said that  he is based on superman as the two share  quite a few traits such as their  character designs the fact that there's  so much mystery around blast's power and  according to fubiki blast can also shoot  laser beams from his eyes just like that  of superman which of course is a very  clear reference  and that is it every s-class heroes  backstory from one punch man make sure  to let us know in the comment section  below who your favorite s-class hero is  and which of the backstories you thought  was the best  if you enjoyed this one punch man video  and you'd like to see more on the  channel make sure to let us know by  smashing that like button saitama style  if you haven't make this the video you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications or you will  miss future one punch man videos  and while you wait for more one punch  man content on the channel why not check  out our huge one punch man playlist that  includes videos on all the s-class  heroes powers all dragon and god level  monsters and more link to that is in the  video description thanks again for  checking out the video we cannot wait to  see you in the next one until then  take care
 

